Package: livecam
Version: __VERSION__
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: xloveee <admin@localhost>
Depends: adduser, ca-certificates, curl
Recommends: caddy
Description: WebRTC livestream SFU and Go proxy
 Prebuilt rust-core + go-proxy for Ubuntu/Debian amd64.
 After install: sudo livecam-setup your.domain you@email.com
 Secrets (SESSION_SECRET, SFU_INTERNAL_SECRET) are generated on
 first setup and reused on upgrade (H22).
